<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Présentation — {{ selected_theme ? selected_theme.name : 'Blog' }}</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 128 128'><text y='1.2em' font-size='96'>⚫</text></svg>">
    {{ encore_entry_link_tags('app') }}
    {% if selected_theme %}
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ path('app_theme_css', { id: selected_theme.id }) }}">
    {% endif %}
    <style>
        body {
            margin-bottom: 48px;
        }
        /* Minimal layout : grille, conteneur, sélecteur. Le thème stylise body, h1, p, .ch_btn */
        .showcase-header { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem; padding: 1rem 1.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; }
        .showcase-select { padding: 0.5rem 2rem 0.5rem 0.75rem; border-radius: 0.375rem; border: 1px solid #d1d5db; font-size: 0.875rem; }
        .showcase-back { font-size: 0.875rem; color: #6b7280; text-decoration: none; }
        .showcase-back:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
        
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header class="showcase-header">
        <a href="{{ path('app_theme_index') }}" class="showcase-back">← Thèmes</a>
       <form method="get" action="{{ path('app_theme_showcase') }}" class="showcase-theme-form" id="theme-form">
            <a href="{{ path('app_theme_edit', { id: selected_theme.id }) }}" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Modifier</a>
        
            <label for="theme-select" >Choisir un thème</label>
            <select name="theme" id="theme-select" class="showcase-select" onchange="this.form.submit()">
                {% for t in themes %}
                    <option value="{{ t.id }}" {{ selected_theme and selected_theme.id == t.id ? 'selected' : '' }}>{{ t.name }}</option>
                {% endfor %}
            </select>
        </form>
    </header>

    <main class="showcase-container pb-48">
        <nav class="ce-menu--navbar ce-menu--navbar-default mb-4">
            <div class="ce-menu-content" style="justify-content: flex-end;">
                <a href="#" class="ce-nav-item">Accueil</a>
                <a href="#" class="ce-nav-item">A propos</a>
                <a href="#" class="ce-nav-item">Contact</a>
            </div>
        </nav>
        
        <div class="ce-two_columns ce-two_columns-no-fluid">
            <div class="grid gap-4 grid-cols-3">
                <div class="col-span-2">
                    <h1 class="ce-header-h1">Bienvenue sur le blog</h1>
                    <p class="ce-text">28 janvier 2026</p>
                    <p class="ce-text">Cette page de présentation permet de prévisualiser vos thèmes. Le texte, les titres et les boutons ci‑dessous sont stylés par le thème sélectionné.</p>
                    <img src="https://www.flashnews.fr/upload/flashnews/55781c676fdd5.jpg" alt="Article" class="ce-image">
                    <article>
                        <h2 class="ce-header-h2 my-4">Premier article</h2>
                        
                        <p class="ce-text">Catégorie : Démo</p>
                        <p class="ce-text">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi ut aliquip ex ea commodo consequat.</p>
                        <p class="ce-text">Duis aute irure dolor in reprehenderit in voluptate velit esse cillum dolore eu fugiat nulla pariatur. Excepteur sint occaecat cupidatat non proident, sunt in culpa qui officia deserunt mollit anim id est laborum.</p>
                        <div class="btn-row">
                            <button type="button" class="ce-button ce-button-primary ce-button-medium">Lire la suite</button>
                            <button type="button" class="ce-button ce-button-default ce-button-medium">Commenter</button>
                        </div>
                    </article>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-6 mt-6">
                        <div class="ce-card ce-card-position-top ce-card-align-top">
                            <div class="ce-video-wrapper ce-video">
                                <img 
                                    src="https://content.charisma.fr/web/videos/thumbs/300/dwOg21y6OfEZ.jpg" 
                                    alt="Video" 
                                    class="ce-card-image ce-video-poster"
                                >
                                <div class="ce-video-icon-player">
                                    <div class="ce-video-icon-player-inner">
                                        <span class="ce-video-icon-player-play"></span>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div role="heading" aria-level="3" class="ce-card-title">Titre vidéo 1</div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="ce-card ce-card-position-top ce-card-align-top ">
                            <div class="ce-video-wrapper ce-video">
                                <img src="https://content.charisma.fr/web/videos/thumbs/300/dwOg21y6OfEZ.jpg" alt="Video" class="ce-card-image ce-video-poster">
                                <div class="ce-video-icon-player">
                                    <div class="ce-video-icon-player-inner">
                                        <span class="ce-video-icon-player-play"></span>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div role="heading" aria-level="3" class="ce-card-title">Titre vidéo 2</div>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="ce-card ce-card-position-top ce-card-align-top">
                            <div class="ce-video-wrapper ce-video">
                                <img src="https://content.charisma.fr/web/videos/thumbs/300/dwOg21y6OfEZ.jpg" alt="Video" class="ce-card-image ce-video-poster">
                                <div class="ce-video-icon-player">
                                    <div class="ce-video-icon-player-inner">
                                        <span class="ce-video-icon-player-play"></span>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div role="heading" aria-level="3" class="ce-card-title">Titre vidéo 3</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-span-1">
                    <div class="ce-container">
                        <h2 class="ce-header-h2 text-center mb-4">Menu</h2>
                        <nav class="ce-menu ce-menu--liste mb-4">
                            <div class="ce-menu-content" style="display: flex; flex-flow: column wrap; justify-content: flex-end; gap: 0rem;">
                                <a href="#" class="ce-nav-item">Accueil</a>
                                <a href="#" class="ce-nav-item">A propos</a>
                                <a href="#" class="ce-nav-item">Contact</a>
                            </div>
                        </nav>
                    </div>

                    <hr class="my-4">

                    <div class="ce-container">
                        <h2 class="ce-header-h2 text-center mb-4">Formulaire de contact</h2>
                        <form class="ce-form mb-4">
                            
                            <div class="ce-form-field">
                                <input type="text" id="nom" class="ce-form-control" placeholder="Nom et prénom">
                            </div>
                            <div class="ce-form-field">
                                <input type="text" id="email" class="ce-form-control" placeholder="Email">
                            </div>
                        </form>
                        <button type="button" class="ce-button ce-button-primary ce-button-medium">S'inscrire</button>
                    </div>
                    <hr class="my-4">
                    <div class="ce-container">
                        <h2 class="ce-header-h2 text-center mb-4">Articles</h2>

                        <article class="ce-card ce-card-position-left ce-card-align-center mb-4">
                            <img src="https://www.flashnews.fr/upload/flashnews/58b94a018d067.png" alt="Article 1" class="ce-card-image ce-card-image-ratio-1_3 cursor-pointer">
                            <div class="ce-card-container-content">
                                <a href="#" class="ce-card-link">
                                    <div class="ce-card-title">Titre Article 1</div>
                                </a>
                            </div>
                        </article>
                        <article class="ce-card ce-card-position-left ce-card-align-center mb-4">
                            <img src="https://www.charisma.fr/fr/upload/articles/679d0975d9bd0.jpg" alt="Article 2" class="ce-card-image ce-card-image-ratio-1_3 cursor-pointer">
                            <div class="ce-card-container-content">
                                <a href="#" class="ce-card-link">
                                    <div class="ce-card-title">Titre Article 2</div>
                                </a>
                            </div>
                        </article>
                        <article class="ce-card ce-card-position-left ce-card-align-center mb-4">
                            <img src="https://www.flashnews.fr/upload/flashnews/6385c36ce6f58.png" alt="Article 3" class="ce-card-image ce-card-image-ratio-1_3 cursor-pointer">
                            <div class="ce-card-container-content">
                                <a href="#" class="ce-card-link">
                                    <div class="ce-card-title">Titre Article 3</div>
                                </a>
                            </div>
                        </article>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        
   
        
    </main>
</body>
</html>
